  "description": "Source-only C++20 deep-learning library (CPU) by Denys Dragunov. The package ships headers (.h/.inl) and sources (.cpp) from the DeepLearning project and injects them into the consumer's native C++ project. The consumer's compiler/toolset controls ABI, precision and SIMD, eliminating MSVC ABI drift issues. Defines USE_AVX2 and USE_SINGLE_PRECISION by default; both can be disabled by setting the corresponding MSBuild properties to 'false'.",
